-      TASK:
-      Implement a receipt-scoped admission reducer that enumerates task-owned checks before execution, replays them, and computes readiness only from those checks. Preserve the full repo-wide suite result as a separate diagnostic. Do not edit the working lease implementation unless a focused red test proves a task-owned defect. Do not load an LLM or make a model-quality claim.
