-      CONCRETE STEPS:
-      0. PRECONDITIONS: hash research-roadmap.yaml and scripts/research_conductor.py; record Exp6633 artifact hash, task-owned fixture inventory, current global-suite receipt, Python, CPU, RAM, disk, and the no-LLM substrate.
